ntor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OCHIAI KIYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OCHIAI, KIYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A pneumatic tire (1) having a troidal shape and including a tread part (2), side wall parts (3) radially inwardly extending from both edges of the tread part (2), and bead parts (4) at the ends of the side wall parts (3), in which a sealant (6) for puncture prevention is extended circumferentially inside the tread part (2).  The pneumatic tire (1) is characterized in that a seal unit (7) composed of a baglike member and the sealant (6) sealed in the baglike member is extended inside the tread part (2) along the circumference of the tire before the vulcanization molding.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un pneumatique (1) de forme annulaire comportant une partie de roulement (2), des parties de parois latérales s'étendant radialement vers l'intérieur depuis les deux bords de la partie de roulement, et des parties talon (4) situées aux extrémités des parties de parois latérales, un matériau d'étanchéité (6) anti-crevaison s'étendant intérieurement autour de la partie de roulement (2). Le pneumatique (1) est caractérisé en ce qu'une unité d'étanchéité (7) composée d'un élément en forme de poche et du matériau d'étanchéité (7) scellé dans l'élément en forme de sac est tirée à l'intérieur de la partie de roulement (2) autour du pneu, avant le moulage de vulcanisation.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>